This theme bundles the following fonts, unmodified. Each is licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and its license is in its folder.

Inter 4.1            Fonts/Inter           https://github.com/rsms/inter
JetBrains Mono 2.304 Fonts/JetBrainsMono   https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono

The folder and disk icons in ThemeImages are from Rik icons by Bertrand
Dekoninck (https://github.com/gnustep/icons-rik), licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). They are not covered by
this theme's BSD license.

From Rik's PNG1024 folder, scaled to 96 by 96 pixels:
  ApplicationFolder, Desktop, DocsFolder, DownloadFolder, Folder, GSFolder,
  ImageFolder, LibraryFolder, MusicFolder, VideoFolder (Rik's MovieFolder),
  HardDisk and Root_PC (Rik's HardDisk), RemovableDisk (Rik's
  DriveRemovableMedia), each also as common_<name>.

Changed for NextBSD: HomeDirectory, LocalFolder, NetworkFolder,
PublicFolder and TemplatesFolder are Rik's Folder with a symbol drawn for
NextBSD in the style of Rik's own (a house, a computer, a globe, two
people, a dashed page).
